{"id":"0ad2193926edf61c","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-thm-stone.md","title":"Stone Representation","display":"thm-stone — Stone Representation","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-stone","aliases":["58-thm-stone"],"display":"thm-stone — Stone Representation","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-stone"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-stone</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-stone — Stone Representation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a5e10857074b912e\" href=\"?note=a5e10857074b912e\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md\">../batch18/58-df-bijective.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_B,1_B,X,\\tau,e\\in V\">\\(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_B,1_B,X,\\tau,e\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_B,1_B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_B,1_B)\\)</span> 使用书内六元接口。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat b_X=\\{u\\in X:u(b)=1\\}\">\\(\\widehat b_X=\\{u\\in X:u(b)=1\\}\\)</span>，只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathbf2^B\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathbf2^B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in B\">\\(b\\in B\\)</span> 时使用；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Clop}(X,\\tau)=\\{C\\in\\tau:X\\setminus C\\in\\tau\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Clop}(X,\\tau)=\\{C\\in\\tau:X\\setminus C\\in\\tau\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>运算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\wedge b\">\\(a\\wedge b\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\vee b\">\\(a\\vee b\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg a\">\\(\\neg a\\)</span> 分别为给定函数图的值；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min\">\\(\\min\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\max\">\\(\\max\\)</span> 使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf2\">\\(\\mathbf2\\)</span> 的自然数次序。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StoneRepresentation}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{StoneRepresentation}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> 的参数顺序保持不变。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bijective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Bijective}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md\">../batch18/58-df-bijective.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{StoneRepresentation}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(X,\\tau,e;B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_B,1_B)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_B,1_B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land X=\\{u\\in\\mathbf2^B:u(0_B)=0\\land u(1_B)=1\n\\land\\forall a,b\\in B\\;(\nu(a\\wedge b)=\\min(u(a),u(b))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{16em}\\land u(a\\vee b)=\\max(u(a),u(b))\n\\land u(\\neg a)=1-u(a))\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\tau=\\{\\bigcup\\mathcal A:\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\{\\widehat b_X:b\\in B\\}\\}\n\\land e=\\{\\langle b,\\widehat b_X\\rangle:b\\in B\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\tau\\;\\Bigl(\\bigcup\\mathcal U=X\\to\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\vec U\\in\\mathcal U^n\\;\nX=\\bigcup_{i&lt;n}\\vec U(i)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\Bigl(x\\ne y\\to\n\\exists U,W\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\land y\\in W\\land U\\cap W=\\varnothing)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{Clop}(X,\\tau)\\;\n(x\\in C\\land C\\subseteq U)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(e,B,\\operatorname{Clop}(X,\\tau))\n\\land e(0_B)=\\varnothing\\land e(1_B)=X\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in B\\;\n\\bigl(e(a\\wedge b)=e(a)\\cap e(b)\\land e(a\\vee b)=e(a)\\cup e(b)\n\\land e(\\neg a)=X\\setminus e(a)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{StoneRepresentation}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(X,\\tau,e;B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_B,1_B)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_B,1_B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land X=\\{u\\in\\mathbf2^B:u(0_B)=0\\land u(1_B)=1\n\\land\\forall a,b\\in B\\;(\nu(a\\wedge b)=\\min(u(a),u(b))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{16em}\\land u(a\\vee b)=\\max(u(a),u(b))\n\\land u(\\neg a)=1-u(a))\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\tau=\\{\\bigcup\\mathcal A:\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\{\\widehat b_X:b\\in B\\}\\}\n\\land e=\\{\\langle b,\\widehat b_X\\rangle:b\\in B\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\tau\\;\\Bigl(\\bigcup\\mathcal U=X\\to\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\vec U\\in\\mathcal U^n\\;\nX=\\bigcup_{i&lt;n}\\vec U(i)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\Bigl(x\\ne y\\to\n\\exists U,W\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\land y\\in W\\land U\\cap W=\\varnothing)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{Clop}(X,\\tau)\\;\n(x\\in C\\land C\\subseteq U)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(e,B,\\operatorname{Clop}(X,\\tau))\n\\land e(0_B)=\\varnothing\\land e(1_B)=X\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in B\\;\n\\bigl(e(a\\wedge b)=e(a)\\cap e(b)\\land e(a\\vee b)=e(a)\\cup e(b)\n\\land e(\\neg a)=X\\setminus e(a)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_B,1_B)\n\\to\\exists X,\\tau,e\\in V\\;\n\\operatorname{StoneRepresentation}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(X,\\tau,e;B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_B,1_B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_B,1_B)\n\\to\\exists X,\\tau,e\\in V\\;\n\\operatorname{StoneRepresentation}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(X,\\tau,e;B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_B,1_B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>点仍按原文选为到二元布尔代数的同态，不改成另一种编码。拓扑、表示映射、紧致性、Hausdorff 性、零维性和满射到闭开代数的条件均已写入形式关系。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a5e10857074b912e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Bijective}$ 取 [[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_B,1_B,X,\\tau,e\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_B,1_B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat b_X=\\{u\\in X:u(b)=1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq\\mathbf2^B","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in B","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Clop}(X,\\tau)=\\{C\\in\\tau:X\\setminus C\\in\\tau\\}","display":false},{"tex":"a\\wedge b","display":false},{"tex":"a\\vee b","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg a","display":false},{"tex":"\\min","display":false},{"tex":"\\max","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StoneRepresentation}_{\\mathsf{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bijective}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\operatorname{StoneRepresentation}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(X,\\tau,e;B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_B,1_B)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_B,1_B)\\\\\n&\\land X=\\{u\\in\\mathbf2^B:u(0_B)=0\\land u(1_B)=1\n\\land\\forall a,b\\in B\\;(\nu(a\\wedge b)=\\min(u(a),u(b))\\\\\n&\\hspace{16em}\\land u(a\\vee b)=\\max(u(a),u(b))\n\\land u(\\neg a)=1-u(a))\\}\\\\\n&\\land\\tau=\\{\\bigcup\\mathcal A:\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\{\\widehat b_X:b\\in B\\}\\}\n\\land e=\\{\\langle b,\\widehat b_X\\rangle:b\\in B\\}\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\tau\\;\\Bigl(\\bigcup\\mathcal U=X\\to\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\vec U\\in\\mathcal U^n\\;\nX=\\bigcup_{i<n}\\vec U(i)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\Bigl(x\\ne y\\to\n\\exists U,W\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\land y\\in W\\land U\\cap W=\\varnothing)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{Clop}(X,\\tau)\\;\n(x\\in C\\land C\\subseteq U)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(e,B,\\operatorname{Clop}(X,\\tau))\n\\land e(0_B)=\\varnothing\\land e(1_B)=X\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a,b\\in B\\;\n\\bigl(e(a\\wedge b)=e(a)\\cap e(b)\\land e(a\\vee b)=e(a)\\cup e(b)\n\\land e(\\neg a)=X\\setminus e(a)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_B,1_B)\n\\to\\exists X,\\tau,e\\in V\\;\n\\operatorname{StoneRepresentation}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(X,\\tau,e;B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_B,1_B).","display":true}],"bytes":2451,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"r